{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2023-01-24 08:00:00', 'title': "UNIVAR SOLUTIONS ANNOUNCES NEW DISTRIBUTION RELATIONSHIP FOR DOW'S KEY ACRYLIC EMULSION POLYMERS IN THE UNITED KINGDOM AND IRELAND", 'text': 'LONDON , JAN. 24, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EUROPE, UNIVAR SOLUTIONS B.V., A SUBSIDIARY OF UNIVAR SOLUTIONS INC. (NYSE: UNVR) ("UNIVAR SOLUTIONS" OR "THE COMPANY"), A LEADING GLOBAL SOLUTIONS PROVIDER TO USERS OF SPECIALTY INGREDIENTS AND CHEMICALS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY HAS BEEN NAMED AS A DISTRIBUTOR FOR DOW\'S (NYSE: DOW) ACRYLIC EMULSION POLYMER PRODUCTS INCLUDED IN THE PRIMAL™ AND UCAR™ LATEX BRAND PORTFOLIOS IN THE UNITED KINGDOM AND IRELAND.'}